      },
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "6da8830a-69b4-4b6c-a024-1ba73a99d700",
          "name": "Get session hosts for a host pool",
          "request": {
            "name": "Get session hosts for a host pool",
            "description": {
              "content": "Returns the VMs that make up the pool — one row per session host with power state, agent status, drain state,\nVM SKU, OS, per-host CPU and memory, and session counts.\nStored inventory rather than a live Azure read, so power and agent state are current as of each row's SyncedAt.\nDescribes the machines, not the users occupying them, and carries no cost data.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "cloud",
                "host-pools",
                ":hostPoolId",
                "session-hosts"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "filter",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Optional filter expression.\n\nSupports JSON and RQL formats:\n\n- JSON: {\"and\":[{\"field\":\"status\",\"op\":\"eq\",\"value\":\"Active\"},{\"field\":\"name\",\"op\":\"ct\",\"value\":\"Smith, John\"}]}\n- RQL: and(eq(status,Active),ct(name,Smith%2C%20John)) — values are URL-decoded; encode reserved characters\n\nOperators:\nand, or, not (logical); eq, neq, ct, nct, sw, nsw, ew, new, gt, gte, lt, lte (predicate)\n\nFields (names are matched case-insensitively):\nactiveSessions, allowNewSession, cpuPercent, hostNameAlias, hostPool, hostPoolId, id, memoryPercent, name, osType, powerState, provider, region, regionId, resourceGroup, resourceGroupId, scalingLifecycleState, sessionHostResourceId, status, subscription, subscriptionId, syncedAt, totalSessions, vmResourceId, vmSku"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "sort",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "Sort expression for ordering results.\n\nFormat:\nfield:direction,otherField:direction\n\nDirections: asc, desc, ascending, descending — defaults to ascending when omitted\n\nFields (names are matched case-insensitively):\nactiveSessions, allowNewSession, cpuPercent, hostNameAlias, hostPool, hostPoolId, id, memoryPercent, name, osType, powerState, provider, region, regionId, resourceGroup, resourceGroupId, scalingLifecycleState, sessionHostResourceId, status, subscription, subscriptionId, syncedAt, totalSessions, vmResourceId, vmSku\n\nDefault when omitted: name:asc."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "<integer>",
                  "description": "The page number to retrieve (1-based). Default: 1."
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "pageSize",
                  "value": "<integer>",
                  "description": "The number of items per page (1-100). Default: 50."
                }
              ],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<uuid>",
                  "key": "hostPoolId",
                  "description": "(Required) The unique identifier of the host pool."
                }
              ]
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "bearer": [
                {
                  "key": "token",
                  "value": "{{bearerToken}}"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
